OL,3,GNEWSAParents' fight to save children's
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents are campaigning to keep a
OL,7,Fchildren's centre in its purpose-built
OL,8,Fbuilding.
OL,10,FUnder government plans announced last
OL,11,Fspring, councils were asked to set up
OL,12,FBest Start Family Hubs.
OL,14,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council (ERYC)
OL,15,Fsaid it had agreed to move services,
OL,16,Fwhich are currently delivered at Hessle
OL,17,FChildren's Centre, to a "flexible,
OL,18,Fcommunity-based network". Alternative
OL,19,Fvenues have yet to be decided.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
